### 1. Reincarnate & Pick a Class

* Type `#reincarnate` to register your adventurer profile.
* Pick your path using `#mage`, `#warrior`, or `#summoner`.

### 2. Learn Skills or Tame Beasts

* Type `#skills` to check available skills or beasts for your class.
* Mages and Warriors spend Skill Points (SP) using `#learn <Skill Name>`.
* Summoners form contracts using `#tame <Beast Name>`.

### 3. Take On Quests & Combat

* Type `#quest` to spawn a monster matched to your level.
* **Summoners:** Type `#summon <Beast Name>` to bring your beast into battle first. Check beast moves using `#beast`.
* Type `#attack <Skill Move Name or>` to strike.
* Defeat the monster to gain Gold and EXP to level up.

### 4. Gear Up at the Shop

* Type `#shop` to browse items in the market.
* Use `#buy <Item Name>` to spend Gold.
* Check your bag with `#inv`.
* Restore stats using `#use <Item Name>`.

### 5. Challenge Players (PvP)

* Challenge another player using `#pvp @player`.
* The tagged player must type `#accept` to start the duel.
* Take turns using `#attack <Skill Name>` until one player falls.

### 6. Romance & Marriage

* Type `#waifu` to list available maidens.
* Type `#hello <Maiden Name>` to interact and boost affection.
* Buy a Dragon Scale from `#shop` and type `#propose <Maiden Name>` to marry her.
* Type `#wife` to view your marital perks.

### 7. Climb the Rankings

* Check your status using `#profile`.
* Type `#lb` or `#top` to view the highest-ranked adventurers in the world.